# ASCII punctuation

Never use an em dash (U+2014) or en dash (U+2013) in any file in this repo:
comments, YAML, Markdown, Python, rules, or commit messages.

Those characters render as garbled text in terminals that are not UTF-8.

Use ASCII instead:

- hyphen-minus `-`
- colon `: `
- comma `, `
- double hyphen `--` in CLI flags only

```yaml
# BAD (em dash between the group and the note)
#   panorama  <em dash> controllers

# GOOD
#   panorama  : controllers
```
